            "id": "01a0d26f-3021-7260-850a-927da91f9b9d",
            "slug": "cocktails-by-the-water",
            "title": "Cocktails by the water",
            "excerpt": "Our poolside bar menu, from zero-proof coolers to long summer drinks.",
            "bodyMarkdown": "The poolside bar has a short menu built for hot afternoons: citrus, ginger, hibiscus and plenty of ice.\n\n### Favourites\n\n- **Zobo spritz**, hibiscus, ginger and lime\n- **Palm sunset**, pineapple, orange and grenadine (alcohol-free)\n- **The 007**, a dry martini for the traditionalists\n\nAsk the bartender for a tasting flight.",
            "bodyHtml": "<p>The poolside bar has a short menu built for hot afternoons: citrus, ginger, hibiscus and plenty of ice.</p>\n<h3>Favourites</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Zobo spritz</strong>, hibiscus, ginger and lime</li>\n<li><strong>Palm sunset</strong>, pineapple, orange and grenadine (alcohol-free)</li>\n<li><strong>The 007</strong>, a dry martini for the traditionalists</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Ask the bartender for a tasting flight.</p>",
