            "title": "Serve up: tennis mornings for beginners",
            "excerpt": "Weekday morning coaching for first-timers, with rackets and balls provided.",
            "bodyMarkdown": "New to tennis? Our weekday morning sessions are designed for you.\n\nA coach walks you through grip, footwork and your first rallies on the clay court. Rackets and balls are included, and sessions are small so you get real attention.\n\nBook a one-hour court slot and ask for a coach at reception, or join the Gold membership for included coaching credits.",
            "bodyHtml": "<p>New to tennis? Our weekday morning sessions are designed for you.</p>\n<p>A coach walks you through grip, footwork and your first rallies on the clay court. Rackets and balls are included, and sessions are small so you get real attention.</p>\n<p>Book a one-hour court slot and ask for a coach at reception, or join the Gold membership for included coaching credits.</p>",
