        {
            "id": "01a0d26f-2ffa-71ce-9360-6f83e6e33b18",
            "slug": "new-floodlights-on-the-arena",
            "title": "New floodlights on the arena",
            "excerpt": "The football pitch and basketball court now run under new LED floodlights.",
            "bodyMarkdown": "We have finished upgrading the sports arena with new LED floodlights, which means brighter games and later kick-offs.\n\nEvening slots are now bookable until 22:00 on both the football pitch and the basketball court. Early evening is the busiest window, so reserve your slot a few days ahead.\n\n> Tip: a five-a-side team can split the hourly price and still pay less than a cinema ticket each.",
            "bodyHtml": "<p>We have finished upgrading the sports arena with new LED floodlights, which means brighter games and later kick-offs.</p>\n<p>Evening slots are now bookable until 22:00 on both the football pitch and the basketball court. Early evening is the busiest window, so reserve your slot a few days ahead.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Tip: a five-a-side team can split the hourly price and still pay less than a cinema ticket each.</p>\n</blockquote>",
