        {
            "id": "01a0d26f-2fee-70c9-a35e-416eac2681a0",
            "slug": "friday-night-live-is-back",
            "title": "Friday Night Live is back",
            "excerpt": "Live band, grill and cocktails return to the poolside deck every Friday.",
            "bodyMarkdown": "Every Friday from 7pm the poolside deck turns into the best seat in Bayelsa.\n\n## What to expect\n\n- A live band playing highlife, afrobeats and covers\n- The grill open until late\n- Two-for-one cocktails until 8pm\n\nTickets are limited, so book ahead from the **Events** page. Groups of six or more can reserve a cabana.",
            "bodyHtml": "<p>Every Friday from 7pm the poolside deck turns into the best seat in Bayelsa.</p>\n<h2>What to expect</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A live band playing highlife, afrobeats and covers</li>\n<li>The grill open until late</li>\n<li>Two-for-one cocktails until 8pm</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Tickets are limited, so book ahead from the <strong>Events</strong> page. Groups of six or more can reserve a cabana.</p>",
